{'symbol': 'APD', 'date': '2021-12-13 07:00:00', 'title': 'ONE OF THE LARGEST GREEN HYDROGEN PROJECTS IN THE WORLD: THYSSENKRUPP SIGNS CONTRACT TO INSTALL OVER 2GW ELECTROLYSIS PLANT FOR AIR PRODUCTS IN NEOM', 'text': "LEHIGH VALLEY, PA., DEC. 13, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0AIR PRODUCTS (NYSE:APD) HAS AWARDED THYSSENKRUPP UHDE CHLORINE ENGINEERS A CONTRACT TO SUPPLY A MORE THAN TWO-GIGAWATT (2 GW) ELECTROLYSIS PLANT FOR ONE OF THE WORLD'S LARGEST GREEN HYDROGEN PROJECTS AT NEOM IN SAUDI ARABIA."}